  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Baby Dragon is the sixth Builder Base Troop unlocked in the Builder Barracks once it has been upgraded to level 6. He is a powerful flying unit and the Builder Base version of the Baby Dragon from the Home Village.",
    "The Tantrum ability is passive, and boosts the Baby Dragon's damage and attack speed when he is separated from other air units by a distance of at least 4.5 tiles."
  ],
